  - title: "B\xDCY\xDCC\xDC A\u011EACI"
    subtitle: "Element \xB7 B\xFCy\xFC e\u015Fyalar\u0131 \xB7 Uzmanl\u0131k \xB7
      Ba\u011Flant\u0131lar taslak"
    accent: {r: 0.34, g: 0.27, b: 0.43, a: 1}
    names:
    - "Mana Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131 I"
    - "R\xFCn Bilgisi"
    - "Kataliz\xF6r"
    - Kaotik Element
    - "Y\u0131k\u0131m B\xFCy\xFCs\xFC"
    - "K\u0131yamet Sevdal\u0131s\u0131"
    - Derin Mana
    - "B\xFCy\xFC Oda\u011F\u0131"
    - "R\xFCn Ustas\u0131"
    - Element Dengesi
    - "Yo\u011Fun B\xFCy\xFC"
    - Kadim Bilgi
    descriptions:
    - "B\xFCy\xFC e\u015Fyalar\u0131n\u0131n ma\u011Faza tekliflerinde g\xF6r\xFCnme
      \u015Fans\u0131na odaklan\u0131r."
    - "\xC7antadaki b\xFCy\xFC e\u015Fyalar\u0131n\u0131 sald\u0131r\u0131 h\u0131z\u0131na
      katk\u0131ya d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr."
    - "Element de\u011Fi\u015Ftirme maliyetini azaltmaya odaklan\u0131r."
    - "Do\u011Fru element e\u015Fle\u015Fmesinin hasar avantaj\u0131n\u0131 geli\u015Ftirir."
    - "Alan hasar\u0131 ve b\xFCy\xFC kritiklerine odaklan\u0131r. Mevcut tek hedef
      sald\u0131r\u0131s\u0131na etkisi belirlenecek."
    - "Element de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdikten sonra ge\xE7ici g\xFC\xE7 sa\u011Flar. Etkin
      oldu\u011Fu dalga ve s\xFCre birlikte se\xE7ilecek."
    - "Yeni uzmanl\u0131k d\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC \xF6nerisi. Etkisi, maliyeti ve a\xE7\u0131lma
      ko\u015Fulu birlikte belirlenecek. \u015Eimdilik puan harcanmaz."
    - "Yeni uzmanl\u0131k d\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC \xF6nerisi. Etkisi, maliyeti ve a\xE7\u0131lma
      ko\u015Fulu birlikte belirlenecek. \u015Eimdilik puan harcanmaz."
