  - title: "HAVAN A\u011EACI"
    subtitle: "Alan hasar\u0131 \xB7 Y\xFCkleme \xB7 Ku\u015Fatma  /  \xD6NER\u0130
      \xB7 Ba\u011Flant\u0131lar taslak"
    accent: {r: 0.43, g: 0.29, b: 0.19, a: 1}
    names:
    - "Barut E\u011Fitimi"
    - "Seri Y\xFCkleme"
    - "Geni\u015F Patlama"
    - "A\u011F\u0131r M\xFChimmat"
    - Element Barutu
    - "Ku\u015Fatma Ustas\u0131"
    - "Sa\u011Flam Namlu"
    - Uzun Menzil
    - "Barut \u0130kmali"
    - "\u0130sabet Ayar\u0131"
    - "\u015Earapnel"
    - "Y\u0131k\u0131m Ustas\u0131"
    descriptions:
    - "Havan hasar\u0131n\u0131 geli\u015Ftiren ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 d\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC.
      Havan a\u011Fac\u0131 i\xE7in yeni tasar\u0131m \xF6nerisi."
    - "At\u0131\u015Flar aras\u0131ndaki y\xFCkleme s\xFCresini iyile\u015Ftirir.
      \xD6neri; hen\xFCz uygulanmad\u0131."
    - "Patlaman\u0131n etkili oldu\u011Fu alan\u0131 geni\u015Fletir. Menzil ile
      patlama alan\u0131 ayr\u0131 tutulur."
    - "Dayan\u0131kl\u0131 tek hedeflere kar\u015F\u0131 uzmanla\u015Fma \xF6nerisi."
    - "Elementli havan kurulumlar\u0131n\u0131n g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC geli\u015Ftirir.
      Say\u0131sal de\u011Ferler belirlenecek."
    - "Kalabal\u0131k dalgalara kar\u015F\u0131 \xFCst kademe uzmanl\u0131k \xF6nerisi.
      Nihai davran\u0131\u015F birlikte tasarlanacak."
    - "Yeni uzmanl\u0131k d\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC \xF6nerisi. Etkisi, maliyeti ve a\xE7\u0131lma
      ko\u015Fulu birlikte belirlenecek. \u015Eimdilik puan harcanmaz."
